1
00:00:04,045 --> 00:00:06,045
[PANTING]

2
00:00:08,341 --> 00:00:11,301
(Penny:)Having a little trouble
catching your breath, there?

3
00:00:12,095 --> 00:00:16,685
(Leonard:)No, I'm good. If my P.E. teachers had
told me this is what I was training for...

4
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:18,230
(Leonard:)...I would have tried a lot harder.

5
00:00:18,393 --> 00:00:20,393
[LAUGHS]

6
00:00:21,146 --> 00:00:24,316
(Penny:)Do or do not, there is no try.

7
00:00:26,568 --> 00:00:29,358
Heh. Did you just quote Star Wars?

8
00:00:30,822 --> 00:00:34,162
(Penny:)I believe I quoted Empire Strikes Back.

9
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:38,459
Ha, ha. Oh, my God.

10
00:00:38,621 --> 00:00:42,171
I am lying in bed with a beautiful woman
who can quote Yoda.

11
00:00:42,333 --> 00:00:43,833
[PENNY LAUGHS]

12
00:00:46,129 --> 00:00:47,259
[CHUCKLES]

13
00:00:48,298 --> 00:00:50,428
(Leonard:)I love you, Penny.

14
00:00:55,055 --> 00:00:58,095
Uh.... Heh.

15
00:00:59,517 --> 00:01:01,687
(Penny:)Thank you.

16
00:01:04,397 --> 00:01:05,567
(Leonard:)You're welcome.

17
00:01:07,609 --> 00:01:10,319
(Leonard:)-I just wanted to put that out there.
-Oh, yeah. No, I--

18
00:01:10,487 --> 00:01:12,277
(Penny:)-I'm glad.
-Yeah-- Oh, good.

19
00:01:12,489 --> 00:01:13,739
(Leonard:)-Good. Glad is good.
-Yeah.

20
00:01:14,115 --> 00:01:16,035
Ha. Ahem.

21
00:01:16,201 --> 00:01:18,661
(Penny:)No-- Um....

22
00:01:20,121 --> 00:01:22,121
So, heh....

23
00:01:22,582 --> 00:01:24,962
(Penny:)It's getting pretty late.
We should, tsk, go to sleep.

24
00:01:25,126 --> 00:01:26,206
(Penny:)-Yeah.
-Okay.

25
00:01:26,377 --> 00:01:27,587
(Leonard:)Yeah, probably.

26
00:01:27,754 --> 00:01:34,024
(Penny:)-Okay. Good night, sweetie.
-Good night.

